faceunlock (0.1.2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Ubuntu 26.04 / polkit 127：修好提权场景下的两处故障。

    polkit 127 把 polkit-1 服务的 PAM 栈放进 socket 激活的
    polkit-agent-helper@.service，默认沙箱是 PrivateDevices=yes +
    DevicePolicy=strict(+DeviceAllow=/dev/null rw)：里面根本没有
    /dev/video*，而且 stderr 既写不通、又是与 gnome-shell 通信的协议流
    的一部分。实测表现是"授权框里人脸打不开摄像头，密码也输不进去"
    （journal: 64/68 次 `无法打开 /dev/video0`、27 次 helper_exit=120、
    polkitd 反复 Request dismissed、pam_unix conversation failed）。

  * pam_faceunlock.c：fork 之前先 readdir /dev 找 video* 设备，没有就毫秒级
    PAM_IGNORE（不发 PAM_TEXT_INFO、不 fork、不碰摄像头；可用模块参数
    video_probe=0 关闭）。子进程除了把 stdout 接到 /dev/null，现在还判断
    stderr 是不是终端：是（sudo/su）保留反馈，不是（polkit socket / GDM /
    journal）一并丢弃，杜绝协议流污染与 EPIPE。退出码 120 单独打日志。
  * bin/faceunlock-auth + faceunlock/preflight.py（新增）：在 import OpenCV
    之前做廉价预检（总开关 / 场景开关 / 设备节点），命中就毫秒级返回 2；
    输出先写 syslog，只有 stderr 是终端时才额外打一行。camera.py 的
    cv2/numpy 改为延迟导入。
  * auth.py：同一预检（仅真摄像头路径）+ _log 的 stderr 兜底加 isatty 限制。
  * polkit：随包安装 drop-in
    /etc/systemd/system/polkit-agent-helper@.service.d/10-faceunlock-camera.conf
    （PrivateDevices=no + DeviceAllow=char-video4linux rw），只放开视频设备，
    其余沙箱限制不变；新增 `faceunlock polkit-camera [on|off|status]`，
    doctor 增加 polkit 一行，panic 与 prerm/postrm 会收回该例外并
    systemctl daemon-reload。
  * 验收套件新增第 12~14 节；README 增加「Ubuntu 26.04 / polkit 127」一节。
  * 安全语义不变：任何失败路径仍然是 PAM_IGNORE -> 回退密码。

 -- faceunlock maintainers <faceunlock@example.com>  Wed, 08 Oct 2026 23:40:00 +0800

faceunlock (0.1.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix a dangerous false alarm in the read-only commands. The template store
    is root-only (/var/lib/faceunlock, 0700), so a normal user running
    `faceunlock status` / `doctor` hit an uncaught PermissionError, while
    `users` / `list` reported the template as "corrupted / tampered with" —
    which made a real tampering report indistinguishable from "you are not
    root".
  * store.py: add StoreUnreadable, raised for PermissionError in load() and
    users(). It deliberately subclasses StoreTampered so every existing
    `except StoreTampered` branch on the authentication path keeps catching
    it, preserving fail-open-to-password semantics. No relaxation.
  * admin.py: report unreadable templates as -2, distinct from -1 (corrupt).
  * cli.py: status / doctor / users / list now say "needs root" and point at
    the privileged path instead of claiming tampering.
  * No change to the PAM stack, the PAM module, or auth.py.

 -- faceunlock maintainers <faceunlock@example.com>  Tue, 07 Oct 2026 12:10:00 +0800

faceunlock (0.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * PAM module pam_faceunlock.so with hard timeout and fail-open semantics.
  * YuNet 2023mar + SFace 2021dec, OpenCV 4.11 vendored under
    /usr/lib/faceunlock/vendor (noble's OpenCV 4.6 cannot run the v2 model).
  * CLI: doctor / status / users / list / enroll / rename / delete / test /
    enable / disable / panic / threshold / service.
  * polkit-gated privileged helper faceunlock-admin (JSON-Lines).

